    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なぁ、顔色悪いけど、
どーしたんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yo, you look a bit
pale. You alright?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……君たちは……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Who are you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたち、『なりきり士』の
お仕事をしてるんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're working as Roleplayers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』だって？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Roleplayers"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何か困ったことがあるなら、
話してみてくださいませんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you're struggling with anything,
would you tell us about it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何かご協力できるかも、
しれません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We might be able to
assist you somehow.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ははっ、君たちみたいな
子どもが僕の力になるだって？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha, so a couple of kids
think they can help me out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>話してみなきゃ
んなのわかんねだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, c'mon. Just tell us what
your problem is, asshole!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの……お話だけでも
聞かせてもらえませんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um... Would you be willing
to tell us a little, at least?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……話だけ……な……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Just tell you a little... Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実は……うちの母さんの店が
乗っ取られそうなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...The truth is... My mother's
shop's getting repossessed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お店、が……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Her shop...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>母さんがひとりでがんばって、
働いて大きくした小物屋だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's worked really hard
to build up her business.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>母さんは
店を大きくするために、
ある男からお金を借りた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To grow it further, she
borrowed some money
from a certain man.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その金が
返せなかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She couldn't pay it back?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、母さんは
ちゃんとお金を返した、
利息も全部！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, she paid it back in
full, interest and all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それなのに、あいつは、
もっと返せって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But he still told her
she owed him more.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>借りたもん返したんなら、
んなもん、無視すりゃいいだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If she'd already paid him back,
can't she just ignore all that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>返済期限を過ぎたから、
遅延金を払えって言うんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He said she'd missed her payment
deadline, so she had to pay late fees!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、それ。
そんな約束とかしたのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, what's that about.
Had she agreed to it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……借用書には、
ちゃんとそのことも書かれてた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It was all there
in the contract.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かにそれをちゃんと
読まなかった母さんも
悪いのかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My mom's probably at
fault for not reading the
contract in full first, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、あいつは敢えて、
それを説明しなかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But he made damn sure not
to explain it to her himself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……最初から、
返せないのをわかってて？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So he knew she wouldn't be able
to repay him from the start?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ……あいつは
最初から店を乗っ取る
つもりだったんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Exactly. He'd been planning to
take her shop from the start!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待ってくれと言っても、
待てば遅延金が増えるだけ
と薄ら笑いを浮かべる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She tried asking for more time,
but he smirked and said more
time would mean more fees...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このまま、あいつに担保として
差し押さえられてる店を
取られるだけ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She named her shop as
collateral, so at this rate,
she'll end up losing it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふたりに
できることなんて
ないよ、たぶん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't think there's
much the two of
you can do...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかな……とりあえず、
そのお金貸した人ってのに
会いにいってみない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You might be right, but...
Should we try to meet with
the moneylender, at least?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>金貸しに
会いに行ってみるだか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Try meeting the moneylender?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よしっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、その金貸したってヤツ、
どこにいるんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, where's this money
lender guy at, anyway?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　ああ……ボエボエなら、
今、町の食材屋にいるはずだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Oh, his name's Gian. He should
be in the grocery store right now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ボエボエって人なんですね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gian, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……でも、あいつに会って、
どうするつもりなんだい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... But, what are
you planning to do?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ。とりあえず、
会ってみないとわかんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dunno. Won't know
until we meet him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……行ってみよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's go see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>返せないもんは
しょうがねーって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you can't pay
him, that's that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、確かに
君の言うとおりだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, you're absolutely right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自業自得だよ、勉強したと
思って、一から出直すよう、
母とがんばるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was our mistake. I thought we
were doing well, but we'll just have
to try again from square one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
